  "clips": [
   {
    "start": 2,
    "dur": 31.07,
    "said": "Go ahead 10-4. I think we need to notify the city of a parade of dogs. I think they just got out of the shelter and they're fixing to go down Main Street to put on a show. 10-4. If I had a guess, about 15 to 20 dogs of all sizes. 10-4. If you have a paw patrol, go bring it up. They may fall up a parade. I tried. I think they had a better parade plan. 10-4."
   },
   {
    "start": 33.67,
    "dur": 3.67,
    "said": "10-4 10-4"
   },
   {
    "start": 37.94,
    "dur": 13.54,
    "said": "Still walking all the way down Main Street. I didn't see any dogs. Yeah, there were four at first. They were coming from Beaver Dam, heading towards Main Street. That should be visible from Main Street, I believe."
   },
   {
    "start": 52.08,
    "dur": 9.76,
    "said": "10-4, sir, it's going to be negative on Bieber, then. Have you seen the unit anywhere?"
   },
   {
    "start": 62.43,
    "dur": 4.43,
    "said": "Coastal going to be negative, I haven't seen the SUV"
   },
   {
    "start": 67.46,
    "dur": 1.62,
    "said": "10"
   }
  ]
 },
